+### Data sources
+
 | What | Where it's from | Licence | Used for |
 | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| Footpath network | OpenStreetMap, via `osmnx` | ODbL 1.0 | 17,274 walkable segments in the CBD bbox |
+| Building footprints & heights | OpenStreetMap, via `osmnx` | ODbL 1.0 | 3,382 footprints; `height` / `building:levels` tags |
+| Street & park trees | [City of Sydney Trees](https://data-cityofsydney.opendata.arcgis.com/datasets/cityofsydney::trees) | **CC BY 4.0 — attribution required** | 7,032 trees in bbox; `TreeHeight`, `TreeCanopyNS` |
+| Satellite imagery | Esri World Imagery, via `contextily` | Esri terms — attribution required | Validation figure only |
+
+> **OpenStreetMap contributors** and **City of Sydney** must both be credited in the app UI and the demo video, not only here. ODbL and CC BY both require it.
+
+### Key libraries
+
+| Library | Licence | Used for |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `osmnx` | MIT | OSM extraction, walk-network graph |
+| `geopandas` / `shapely` | BSD-3 | All geometry; shadow sweeps, segment differences |
+| `pvlib` | BSD-3 | Solar position — we did not roll our own |
+| `pandas` / `pyarrow` | BSD-3 / Apache-2.0 | Hourly exposure table, parquet |
+| `contextily` / `matplotlib` | BSD-3 / PSF | Validation figure |
